+    "Section 2 fixes the native X-Y vertex-separator definition and Theorem 4 "
+    "gives the complete-binary-tree construction: a vertex at depth i belongs "
+    "to a separator of excess i.  The Introduction's O*(4^k) FPT result and "
+    "Theorem 3's explicit separator enumeration rule out Track A; this module "
+    "therefore declares Track B and measures a generic vertex-split max-flow "
+    "solver.  Affine relabelling and randomly subdivided edges remove position, "
