+"""Verified problem generator for arXiv:1104.5361.
+
+The family uses the binary-tree lower-bound construction in Section 2 of
+Razgon, "Large Isolating Cuts Shrink the Multiway Cut".  It asks for an exact
+X--Y vertex separator containing a marked vertex.  Instances are generated by
+composition of separator frontiers; the planted witness is never recovered by
+solving the generated graph.
