The oracle loop is behaving as a ladder should: the compact easy instance has already been solved, so it will escalate through the named presets rather than treating that as a family failure. I’ll use the first level that all oracle attempts fail, then realign `SHIPPING_DIFFICULTY` and rerun every local gate there.
