Local results include 0/200,000 random guesses, five attacks at 0/8 each, 140/140 canonical-key symmetry checks, and a reference max-flow solver succeeding 8/8 at 2,350,226 mean edge scans. The compact affine-tree route remained easy for the oracle pool.

